`judgeHome` reads a file against its base and the records' render; `settleHomes` unlinks each agreed home and stands the carrier off where a home holds a hand's bytes; `unlinkHome` removes a file the judge agreed to. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

